{"translation":{"id":"cmn_feb","name":"免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"FEB","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: 免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"281f45e9c6d64d9cf8e618e4fd7d2d961bebba0f46a534312de0f8ea52a83755","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/books.json","numberOfBooks":27,"totalNumberOfChapters":260,"totalNumberOfVerses":7959,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1TI","translationId":"cmn_feb","name":"提摩太前书","commonName":"提摩太前书","title":"提摩太前书","order":54,"numberOfChapters":6,"sha256":"1283a295c0ef7e56f757ad6e7e76c1668be08ddb2a26a8cc24ad7c4d20c6e4fd","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1TI/1.json","lastChapterNumber":6,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1TI/6.json","totalNumberOfVerses":113},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["首先，我想鼓励你为每个人祈祷：请求上帝，代表他们提出要求，表示感谢。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["为君王和所有类型的领袖也这样祷告，让我们可以过上平静祥和的生活，时刻想着上帝，认真对待生活。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我们的救主上帝会认为这是好事情，可让他喜悦。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["他希望所有人都得救，真正理解真理是什么。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["因为只有一个上帝，在上帝和人类之间只有一个中间人，那就是降生为人的基督耶稣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他舍弃自己，以使我们都能被赢回，在恰当的时间显示证据。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我受到指派分享这个讯息，成为信使，",{"noteId":4},"教授异族人",{"noteId":5},"，让他们相信上帝和真理。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我真正希望的是所有地方的男人都没有愤怒或争论，能够虔诚地向上帝祈祷。",{"noteId":6}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["照样，女人应该端庄、适度、恰如其分地装扮，她们的美不应来自其发型、佩戴的黄金和珍珠珠宝或昂贵的服装，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["却要以善行为美，这才是愿意追随上帝的女性恰当的行为。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["女人应该学会保持安静，尊重她们所在的地位。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我不允许女人成为引导者，或去控制男人；她们应该保持安静。",{"noteId":7}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["因为先造了亚当，后造的夏娃；"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["并非亚当受到欺骗，而是夏娃被彻底欺骗，在罪中堕落。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["但女人仍然可以通过做母亲而获得救赎，",{"noteId":8},"只要他们始终保持信心、爱心、遵循圣洁而庄重的生活。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":4,"caller":"+","text":"原意为“使徒。”","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":7}},{"noteId":5,"caller":"+","text":"原意为“异教徒。”","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":7}},{"noteId":6,"caller":"+","text":"原意为“举起圣洁的手。”","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":8}},{"noteId":7,"caller":"+","text":"或平静，宁静。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":12}},{"noteId":8,"caller":"+","text":"“通过生育。”对这节经文的含义有很多争论……","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":15}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1TI/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1TI/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1TI/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}